      "description": "A U.S. Air Force Douglas A-1G Skyraider (s/n 52-132528, \"War Monger\") of the 6th Air Commando Squadron at Pleiku Air Base, South Vietnam, circa in 1968. It later served with the 1st SOS and was then transferred to the South Vietnamese Air Force where it served with the 516th and 518th Fighter Squadrons. It was one of eleven Skyraiders to escape to Thailand in late April 1975.",
